{
  "schema": "missionlab-plan/1",
  "name": "Clean House: Escalation",
  "id": "sc-cleanhouse-escalation",
  "briefing": [
    "Clean House, escalation. Clear the house and hold the upper floor, north end.",
    "Stay there for three minutes in one go. Waves come from the north, each a little later.",
    "You have fifteen minutes from the start. Dead players come back twice."
  ],
  "squad": [2, 4],
  "minutes": 15,
  "scene": "",
  "navFile": "suburbv2.bytes",
  "seed": 0,
  "notes": [
    "Pacing: rising pressure. Few enemies at the start, then a wave of two patrols at 90 s and every 75 s after it, four waves in all, and one last push at 7 minutes.",
    "Completion: a player stays inside the upper floor's north room for 180 s without leaving (trigger 3 'Hold the floor'); trigger 4 'Held' then ends the mission as a success. Failure: trigger 6 'Overrun' at 15 minutes ends it as failed (with a warning at one minute and at ten seconds); everyone dead also ends it, as in the game.",
    "Rally: reaching the north room (trigger 1 'Upstairs') calls every enemy within 25 m to it, so the hold starts with a fight.",
    "Optional content: the third patrol of each wave comes one mission in two (chance 50). The hold and both endings do not depend on it.",
    "Minutes and squad are the author's estimate; no playtest has measured them yet."
  ],
  "triggers": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Upstairs",
      "when": "zone",
      "pos": [-20.0, 3.68, 4.0],
      "radius": 4.5,
      "rally": 25,
      "facePlayer": true,
      "message": "This is the room. Hold it for three minutes: they are coming to you."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "name": "Waves",
      "when": "time",
      "delay": 90,
      "repeat": 75,
      "times": 4,
      "hunt": true,
      "facePlayer": true,
      "message": "{time} in: another wave from the north. {enemies} left."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "name": "Hold the floor",
      "when": "hold",
      "pos": [-20.0, 3.68, 4.0],
      "radius": 4.5,
      "hold": 180,
      "facePlayer": true,
      "message": "Three minutes held."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "name": "Held",
      "when": "after",
      "after": 3,
      "delay": 5,
      "facePlayer": true,
      "message": "The floor is yours: mission accomplished.",
      "end": "success"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "name": "Last push",
      "when": "time",
      "delay": 420,
      "hunt": true,
      "red": true,
      "facePlayer": true,
      "message": "Everything they have left is coming now."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "name": "Overrun",
      "when": "time",
      "delay": 900,
      "warn": true,
      "red": true,
      "facePlayer": true,
      "message": "Too late: the house is lost.",
      "end": "failed"
    }
  ],
  "objectives": [],
  "respawn": {
    "after": 30,
    "times": 2
  },
